### Block 2 - Persistence context and entity states
### Select the "local" environment. Needs at least one product: run 01-entities.http first.

### Entity lifecycle: TRANSIENT -> MANAGED -> DETACHED -> MANAGED -> REMOVED
### Q: when does the object become a row? (watch the INSERT in the console)
### Q: what does em.find return after detach? Same instance or a new one?
POST {{host}}/demo/states

### First-level cache: two finds in one transaction = one SELECT, same instance
### Q: why does a JPQL query still hit the DB but return the SAME instance?
### Q: what changes when the two finds happen in two transactions?
GET {{host}}/demo/identity?productId={{productId}}

### Does modifying an object always produce an UPDATE?
### Q: what happens to the change after the transaction is closed?
GET {{host}}/demo/detached-change?productId={{productId}}&newStock=999
